Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 03:27:37 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 08/17] verify: pipelined windows of a batch verifier with
 their own graphs, lane rope base, shared arenas and carve signature
 (STRATA_SOLO_PIPELINE / STRATA_SPEC_LANES, our 81015495 7db06746 25221fc9
 ba107591)

set_pl_mode / exec_pl_[2][kVerifyLongT + 1] / pl_exec(sl, T) follow upstream's [sel_long_][T] graph arrays;
capture_all(err, up_to) applies up_to inside each select variant. v0.2.12's window-graph eviction (#3702) can free
an exec_[sl][T] that an all-resident stage's pl_exec shares: set_pl_mode(true) captures again (under NoEvict) what
capture_all made and is gone, or refuses. kLiveMax 32. Off (rope_base_ 0, pl_mode_ off, no external arena): the
same graphs and bytes as before.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
